---
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>About Wizkid</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/src/styles/global.css" />
  </head>

  <body>
    <Header />

    <main>
      <h1>About Wizkid</h1>
      <h2>Learn more about the Starboy legacy.</h2>

      <div class="about-card">
        <img src="/images/wizkid-about.jpg" class="about-img" alt="Wizkid" />

        <p>Ayodeji Ibrahim Balogun, popularly known as <strong>Wizkid</strong>, is one of Africa’s most 
          influential music icons. Born in Surulere, Lagos, he rose from humble beginnings to become a 
          global superstar.</p>

        <p>From record-breaking albums to Grammy-winning collaborations, Wizkid continues to elevate 
          Afrobeats onto the world stage with his signature sound and effortless style.</p>

        <p>His cultural impact, artistic versatility, and worldwide influence cement his place as one 
          of the greatest African artists of all time.</p>
      </div>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
